## What We Are Building

**The Star:** an AI movie factory (NORTH_STAR.md). **The Planet (now):** a **working Mode 3** (PLANET.md) — Polина (smart "head", paid tier) + the deterministic factory-chain + her cheap "employee" agents drive an episode brief→final-cut WITHIN cost limits, and the Director touches only **4 gates**: **Brief · Script · 2 video-pilots · Final-cut+Publish** (+ an auto budget-ceiling halt). Landing this on one episode (E13) unlocks the 10–20 episode season.

**The refactor** (plan: `~/.claude/plans/calm-percolating-sifakis.md`, adversarial-hardened by 3 lenses): a **tiered cascade** so each event is handled by the cheapest sufficient tier and expensive intelligence fires rarely — factory-code (Tier0,$0) → cheap junior/nudger (Tier1) → Opus-Polина (Tier2, emergency) → human (Tier3, hard-limits + few creative gates). Two axes, coupled at the gates: **autonomy** (per-gate policy) and **cost** (dominated by Polина's variance + generation, NOT studio text).

**Director optimization (the reorder):** instead of generating ALL refs → review → video pilots, do **2 refs → 2 video pilots → approve the 2 VIDEO shots → THEN remaining refs → videos**. Saves money (no blind full-ref spend) + collapses two visual gates into one. Ref-animatic batch review → replaced by **per-reference canon-checking** (canon violation → Director STOP).

